{
  "$comment": "IceWM's default keybinds from nixpkgs' icewm (nixos-26.05): the Key* preferences (their defaults, documented in share/icewm/preferences; the action is the preference name) and the launchers in share/icewm/keys (the action is the command; `switchkey ` marks a switchkey line). Regenerate with scripts/keybinds/extract-x11-wms.py.",
